      "en": "This is labelled as the monthly basic amount of the Ciudad de Ceuta minimum-income scheme (Ingreso Mínimo de Inserción Social en Ceuta) (600 EUR at the latest of 2 recorded values since 2016-01-01). It is used once in bsarg_es's BenCalc as the comp_perTU parameter for '63 - Ceuta: GMI amount'. The country report instead states the scheme's minimum benefit is 300 EUR and it increases 10% per additional member up to a maximum of 420 EUR (for five-plus-member households) — figures roughly half this constant's value — so the current parameter may reflect an uprating adopted after the period covered by the country report's 2022-2025 table; confidence is lowered accordingly."
